I began learning English when I was 6. Such an early start made all the difference. Since I turned 12 people have occasionally been mistaking me for a native speaker. I also began learning German, but I was 15 by then, and, first, I never managed to master the langue, and second, Ive mostly forgotten what I'd learned for lack of use...

May I ask why you decided to learn Polish? It seems like a somewhat random thing to do 😃. It's not like speaking the language makes a huge difference to life on Earth...

