Sorry that it's been a nerve striking day today! I don't blame you. I know you bristled at the commenter yesterday who, rather unfairly, said you aligned with bullies. I can't imagine most other people out here, most certainly not me, would agree with that. Then, I also disagree with those some call bullies.
